{
  "name": "HL·03 Payments",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL·03 Payments (lesson 6.4, 2.5 + 6.2)\nVerify signature → verify the transaction → check the amount → mark paid AND decrement stock in ONE database call → paid event → HL·04.\nThe secret lives in ONE place: env var PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY, used by both the signature check and the verify call (Glitch's fault 1).\nDuplicates: the UPDATE only touches orders still \"quoted\", and paystack_ref is unique.\n\n**Credentials:** Postgres (Supabase), Telegram.\n**Environment:** PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY (TEST), NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto, N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false.\n**Replace:** YOUR_HL04_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "6e7b8182-55bd-4b3c-b3bc-bed84e6184e4",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -288
      ]
    },
